From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: timvdhoorn <timvdhoorn@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:50:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] feat(mobile): add the desktop Claude theme as a mobile
 palette

The desktops publish a Claude palette as the claude environment theme.
Mobile keeps its own appearance settings, so it now ships the same
palette as a theme card next to the built-ins, in light and dark. Roles
the file leaves out fall back to T3 Chat as on desktop; the send fill is
darkened to keep white button text at 4.5:1.
